# Shared agent rules

- Read TASK.md first. Do not deviate from scope.
- Never commit `.env`, keys, `id.json`, `target/`, `.anchor/`.
- Conventional commits, small commits.
- Before final push:
  - `anchor build` (if you touched the program)
  - `pnpm build && pnpm lint` (if you touched an app)
- If you hit ambiguity — stop, write the question in TASK.md under
  the "QUESTIONS" section, and don't make things up.
- Don't open a PR or merge to main. Push your branch only.
